### GET /video/{idYoutubeWatch} — encontrado (dado real, specs/seed/omni8.videos.json)
# Esperado: 200, corpo = Video serializado (_id=videoId, title, url, channel_id=channelSlug,
# channel, channel_url, thumbnail, viewnum, date, createdAt, updatedAt).
GET {{baseUrl}}/video/up0im04clS8

### GET /video/{idYoutubeWatch} — nao encontrado
# Esperado: 200 (nao 404) + corpo `null` — paridade com Video.findOne do Mongo original
# (ver specs/fase-3-endpoints-leitura.md, "Descobertas" #3).
GET {{baseUrl}}/video/does-not-exist
